[Music]  hello there it's july in gaming this is  the month before the aaa games start  releasing and even though it's a slow  month i've found a handful of games  worth your time and money and a couple  of free experiences if you're saving  your cash for another time so let's do  this  the headline game of the month is all  about a cat stray a mystery solving  cyberpunk wandering delivery cat we are  tasked with reuniting our lost family  and solving an ancient mystery that  mystery i guess will be where the heck  are all the humans the greatest thing  about being a cat is the ability to go  almost anywhere and we'll also have our  own android too a drone named b12 if  you're a cat lover you're likely already  hyped for stray but even though i  dislike cats i'm kinda into this too  stray releases on july 19th on ps4 ps5  and pc and there is a kicker to stray  those on playstation plus will get it  for free but only those on the deluxe  version the premium version sony still  has a great deal of ironing out of ps  plus to be done so i wondered if you'd  be interested in a breakdown of the  service here in the uk we were the last  to get the new ps plus so i'm way behind  other content creators but i'd still  like to make it  another animal exploration game dropping  on july 19th is endling extinction is  forever a single-player 3d side-scroller  all about keeping the last of your  species alive we play as the motherfucks  trying to keep her cubs away from all  kinds of peril and onto safer pastures  the game describes itself as an  eco-conscious game which usually means  humans are depicted as the bad guys  building roads forcing toxins into  rivers you know good old humanity  forcing nature out of its home each cub  we raise is said to have its own  personality so one will be more  inquisitive and venture closer to danger  whereas another may be eaten by an owl  i'm not lying legit that could happen we  need to be observant as we search for a  safe place to take a nap endling retails  at around 30 that's 25 quid here in the  uk and comes to ps4 pc xbox and twitch  [Music]  july sees the release of arcade geddon  an ever evolving cooperative multiplayer  shooter their target audience is those  shooter fans and battle royale players  and all this comes at an entrance fee of  around twenty dollars there are rumors  that arcader geddon is coming to ps plus  but i can't comment on that right now  you should come back on wednesday  playstation fam here in arcade geddon  the premise season arcade owner  accidentally spread a dangerous virus to  all the machines and we must go in and  save the day it's been in early access  for almost a year now and in that time  we've seen many core games and mini  games too from surviving unlimited horde  to playing a futuristic basketball game  it appears that the basic foundations  are in place and pretty much anything  that can be imagined can be turned into  a game so it's effectively like fortnite  creative for people who've had enough  fortnite for now so will you try it  [Music]  speaking of free games here are a few  you can play right now firstly remember  the capcom arcade stadium i told you  about last year a hub application like  an arcade for all of capcom's retro  games to live in well randomly they give  away games for free from time to time  for a limited time and right now it's  possible to download street fighter 2  the world warrior totally free you'll  want to hurry though as this promotion  will likely end on july 1st street  fighter 2 was the game which made  one-on-one fighters the biggest genre in  the world this was really where it all  began in arcades so if you want to see  what all people like me called gaming in  the 1990s download capcom's arcade  stadium and pick up street fighter 2 for  free if you're quick enough  [Music]  another free game no let's not call it a  game another free experience is saints  row boss factory the new and improved  saints row is coming for gta's crown  next month in august and to wet our  appetite it's possible to create your  character now a highly detailed custom  creator can be used to waste countless  hours perfecting the right eyebrows or  to make complete abominations hench  firemen weird vampires i'm sure  someone's even made agent 47 by now and  in fact whilst i was researching this  the website here tracks a number of the  celebrity players people have made this  week look at this it's the rock i'll be  back soon to tell you all about the new  saints row because it's been a while  since gta had any competition but for  now boss factory is out right now so  someone please make shrek  and a huge free game is scheduled to  drop in july 2022 multiverses a platform  fighter good enough to rival smash bros  the open beta essentially the soft  release of the game is confirmed for  this month yet no fixed date is here  while i'm writing this last month the  closed beta took place and really  impressed a lot of people the premise is  to beat the living daylights out of each  other to a point where your opponent  cannot get back on the platform the plan  is to have this game around for years to  continuously update the roster with new  characters from warner brothers owned  franchises which means one day  effectively neo from the matrix could be  able to go up against whacking phoenix's  joker on day one 16 characters are  confirmed with vastly different move  sets and abilities dc heroes looney  tunes scooby-doo's greatests are here  and even arya from game of thrones no  form of media is off the table here  films tv shows video games cartoons they  can all be in this game there is great  depth to master yet it has this pick up  and play feel too so when the beta drops  i urge you to try it games like this can  have a scarily high skill ceiling and  being late to the party can make it even  harder multiversus could be the biggest  game of the year and it's totally free  to play  [Music]  back to full price games and f1 i don't  usually cover sports games because each  season their differences are so  negligible it's not worth our time but  this year it's like a new game f1 thanks  to the many rule changes in the real  world sport the digital world sport is  now forced to copy them and that gives  us f-122 there are new sessions like the  sprint race optimizing pit stops and  formation laps is now critical and here  you can even change your wallpaper in  your office  very f1 i guess and for those who want  to raise up the ranks like charles  leclerc and george russell there is also  f2 formula 2 to get your hands on if any  of that floats your boat look out for  f-122 on july 1st on pc xbox and of  course playstation  and one for the oldies now remember  clinoa it's been 25 years since the  platformer released and now we have  clinoa fantasy reverie series a  compilation of clonoa door to phantom  mill and clonoa 2 lunati's veil which  itself was a remake of the 2001 game  very meta i probably butchered so many  words there too this likely has a very  specific very niche audience and if  you're in it then know that clinoa now  runs at 60 frames a second and at 4k  with newly added difficulty adjustments  because old games were legit too hard  two-player co-op mode is confirmed too  look out for it on july 7th on  playstation xbox pc and switch oh and  finally a quick note that madison the  horror game we spoke of last month was  pushed back into july you can now be  scared poopless on july 8th instead so  what you're playing this month stray is  my jam this time around and i may give  arcade geddon a chance too but what  about you i'm adam you're awesome i'll  see you next time  [Music]  hey

